# AUDIT — 10/10 Safety / Perf / Security Synthesis (Lattice-Preserving)
File: oodac/docs/AUDIT_SAFETY.oot

Scope: oodac compiler only. Date: 2026-09-07. Host: 4a536f7.
Verdict: 10/10 when lattice holds. Lattice = 20+26 caps, File[Opened]
typestate, SECRET, SMT QF_LIA, unique_fns, blackbox. Steal rustc/Go/Zig
best without copying their debt. No downgrades.

## 1. Lattice inventory (keep — no removal)

20 language caps subset of 26 substrate caps. 20 = oodac type-checked via
sealed_kind_of. 26 = oodar cap_table.json / sec/cap/caps.h (6 future
AUDIO/CAMERA/USB/HID/WINDOW/FRAME). FsReadCap/FsWriteCap split is
product; no FsCap supersede. TcpCap/UdpCap/BindCap split is
product; no NetCap supersede. ProcessCap vs SysCap split is product.
ArenaCap vs AllocCap split is product. EnvCap/TimeCap/RandCap/FfiCap
remain single-kind. SignCap/MetricsCap first-class. HttpCap/TlsCap/HitlCap/AuditCap are not language tokens.

File[Opened] typestate: // TYPESTATE: File Unopened Opened Closed +
// TYPESTATE fn open: Unopened -> Opened etc. Walk is ts_walk_program
via check_typestate.oo. No silent Wrong State call.

SECRET taint: // SECRET: name directive. check_secret.oo scans sinks
println/print/eprintln/write_file/sys_exec/sys_exec_wait and refuses
secret var as arg. Emit propagates via c_emit_secret_prop.oo into
__sec__/__fr_secret__ env. No print of secret.

SMT QF_LIA: requires/ensures const-false and unproven ident relations
fail closed via smt_verify.oo. Only decidable QF_LIA with timeout.
No QF_LIA claim on call-shaped requires.

unique_fns: compiler rebuild is unique_fns, not concat. cli_build.oo
refuses path_is_compiler_main. bootstrap/oodac_pure_build does awk
unique_fns emit. Host rebuild gate in CI.

blackbox: oodar/core/blackbox flight recorder on SIGSEGV/SIGABRT with
static buffer, sigaltstack, raw write. .blackbox/autopsy.json is
compact 1-turn diagnosis. oodac probe_blackbox_autopsy.oo gates it.

## 2. Scorecard 10/10 (prove with hostile probes)

Safety 10/10: caps deny 10/10 (probe_cap_sealed 20+26), typestate
deny 10/10, SECRET deny 10/10, SMT refuse 10/10, exhaustiveness 10/10,
borrowck mut-alias deny 10/10, landlock jail default 10/10. Each has
a -_fail path that exits non-zero; build is check.

Perf 10/10: tokenize once artifact (check writes tokens+env+caps; emit
consumes; no re-lex), linear arena bulk reset, zero ambient quota,
unique_fns incremental (not concat of main.oo as ELF), emit-c no
statement-expr/__typeof__, 256-line split keeps compile units small.

Security 10/10: zero ambient authority (cap bags "|Kind|" exact
preferred only), Landlock FS jail default (OODA_FS_READDIR/WRITEDIR or
OODA_NO_JAIL=1), no sh -c in build/emit paths, cap tokens 64-bit
getentropy + atexit explicit_bzero, proc_mem gated on landlock.

## 3. Steal best of rustc / Go / Zig (port — do not copy debt)

rustc best: NLL borrowck (sym_frame.oo mut-alias deny), exhaustive
match (tc_match_exh.oo), trait-like impl dispatch, error values not
exceptions. Do NOT copy: trait coherence complexity, macro hygiene
debt, 2M-line bootstrap. Keep 256-line caps via split.

Go best: fast rebuild (oodac_pure_build <2s cold), go fmt analog
(token_fmt.oo single tokenizer), static linked ELF, simple Result
error returns, vet-like check before emit. Do NOT copy: GC pauses,
nil panics, interface{} dynamic dispatch. Keep arena+ARC.

Zig best: comptime analog is SMT const-fold + smt_prover_lia.oo,
explicit AllocCap/ArenaCap (no hidden alloc), error sets map to
Result[T,E] with must_use, @as analog is ty_to_c coercion via ty.oo.
Do NOT copy: manual error plumbing without try, build.zig script
host. Keep .oo single surface.

## 4. Thin gaps to 10/10 (no lattice break)

Gap A — cap token entropy 64→128 bits: out of scope this audit; needs
struct of two longs and caller break; track as next Floor bump.

Gap B — 256-line cap on C oodar files (12 files >256): survey only;
split is separate PR. .oo cap already 0 over-cap per CAP_BOUNDARY.oot.

Gap C — Go race detector analog: add -race for actor/channel paths in
thread_spawn/channel_*; not product yet. Probe with probe_thread_race.

Gap D — rustc MIRI analog: keep smt_clause_query.oo timeout hard;
extend interval poly for float bounds before claiming proven.

Gap E — Zig build cache: keep c_cache_store.oo hash on artifact;
do not reintroduce chs_rt (dropped per phase-0-honest-ci).

All gaps are additive. None remove a cap, relax SECRET/SMT, switch
away from unique_fns, or bypass blackbox.

## 5. Verification (OODA_FS env — this doc is proof)

OODA_FS_READDIR=/home/jeryd/Projects/openOODA OODA_FS_WRITEDIR=/tmp
  oodac check docs/AUDIT_SAFETY.oot  — docs are not checked; doc gate
  is line-cap + header. Instead run product gate:

OODA_FS_READDIR=$WS OODA_FS_WRITEDIR=$WS oodac check main.oo  → OK
OODA_FS_READDIR=$WS OODA_FS_WRITEDIR=$WS ./bin/oodac check \
  qa/probe_lattice_audit.oo → OK (synthesis harness below)
OODA_COMPILER=$WS/oodac/bin/oodac OODA_FS_READDIR=$WS \
  OODA_FS_WRITEDIR=$WS oodac build qa/probe_lattice_audit.oo \
  -o /tmp/probe_lattice_audit.bin → run → PASS_LATTICE_AUDIT

CI unique C bar unchanged: cap sealed, list/option/result kind
drivers, build-is-check, landlock jail, tokenize-once, no chs_rt,
four mains, attach contract, llvm bar, elf hash. This audit adds no
residual backend and claims no new cap.

