## 7. Commit rule

Commit after +0.3 only when: oodac check on *.oo passes with
OODA_FS env, blackbox validate_codex_format ≤256 + Academy header 4
lines passes, get_audit_log tail clean, no downgrade (no cap widen,
no concat, no FsCap/NetCap supersede return). Push when success.
